# Scene2-3-8

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐3‐8
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:19_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『牢屋敷前』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR8,ArmL8
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:一走出监牢<br>我就看到了汉娜跟雪莉。|#0203Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们两个正拿着湿透的衣服<br>站在树下。|#0203Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:树与树之间挂了一根绳子，<br>看来她们是想晾晒衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:等等，雪莉！<br>晾的时候请先把衣服的皱褶给拉平！|#0203Adv08_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好～是这样吗？|#0203Adv08_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到汉娜的提醒后，<br>雪莉便拉扯衣服……|#0203Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 布が破れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_45 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊。|#0203Adv08_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:手上的衣服就被<br>活生生地撕开了一个大口子。|#0203Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Flushed,ArmR7,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不小心撕破了……欸嘿☆|#0203Adv08_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你还“欸嘿”！<br>你真是个傻大力！|#0203Adv08_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起～！<br>我也没用力啊，真没想到……|#0203Adv08_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜无奈地叹了一口气，<br>然后一把抢过雪莉手中的衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:缝补一下应该还能穿。<br>或者用来做舞台服的材料也行……|#0203Adv08_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是的，我来把皱褶整平，<br>雪莉负责晾吧。|#0203Adv08_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:好嘞～！|#0203Adv08_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们两个辛苦了。|#0203Adv08_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到我的问候，<br>她们两个转过头来。|#0203Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR10,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗！<br>嗯哼！我们在洗衣服哦！|#0203Adv08_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看起来是这样呢。|#0203Adv08_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以前，<br>汉娜曾对囚犯服表示过不满。|#0203Adv08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她觉得穿了一天就拿去烧毁太浪费，<br>洗干净了还能穿。|#0203Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然对是否违反规定有些许忧心，<br>但汉娜好像直接跟典狱长谈判并成功获得了允许。<br>这份行动力着实让人敬佩。|#0203Adv08_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自此以后，<br>每天都能看到汉娜不辞劳苦地在洗衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜利索地把衣服摊开拉平，<br>俨然一副持家有道的主妇模样。|#0203Adv08_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，这次要晾的就这么多了。<br>接下来我就把这篮子里的都洗了。|#0203Adv08_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜从身边的一个篮子里拿出衣服，<br>放进盛满水的洗衣盆里。|#0203Adv08_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后拿起一个不知道从哪里找到的洗衣板<br>开始搓洗衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:看我用力搓搓搓搓搓搓！|#0203Adv08_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:该怎么说呢……<br>大小姐人设跑哪去了？|#0203Adv08_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉一边把汉娜交给自己的衣服晾起来，<br>一边疑惑地说道。|#0203Adv08_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你话真多呢！<br>快闭嘴给我乖乖晾衣服去好吗！|#0203Adv08_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR8,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:受到汉娜斥责，<br>雪莉赶紧继续晾衣服去了。|#0203Adv08_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗要是有空的话也给我来帮忙！|#0203Adv08_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话锋突然一转，指向了在一旁默默看着她们的我。|#0203Adv08_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0203Adv08_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:未等我回答，汉娜就把还没清洗的衣服扔向我。<br>我来不及反应，一把就接住了。|#0203Adv08_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么连我也要洗衣服？|#0203Adv08_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:自己穿的衣服，<br>就应该自己洗自己晾！<br>这不是理所当然的吗！|#0203Adv08_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜扔给我的，<br>确实就是我穿过的衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这么一说，我确实也无话可说。|#0203Adv08_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的理由非常正确。<br>最起码，我是这样认为的。|#0203Adv08_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我拿起另一块洗衣板，<br>在另一个洗衣盆里开始搓洗衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我就陪她们一阵子吧……）|#0203Adv08_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我陪着汉娜和雪莉<br>一起帮忙洗了衣服。|#0203Adv08_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

